{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stormgate \u2013 Original Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Music by Nga Weng Chio, Frank Klepacki, Tracy Bush, David Ortega, Stephan Schutze &amp; Alexander Brandon</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Audio Direction by Alexander Brandon</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the heart of the conflict with the official <i>Stormgate</i> Original Soundtrack \u2014 a cinematic and emotional journey through Frost Giant Studios\u2019 epic real-time strategy universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With original music by Nga Weng Chio, Frank Klepacki, Tracy Bush, David Ortega, Stephan Schutze, and Audio Director Alexander Brandon, this dynamic soundtrack blends sweeping orchestral arrangements, gritty electronic textures, and powerful vocal performances to bring <i>Stormgate</i>'s world and factions to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack also features the ethereal voice of Ayana Haviv, whose vocals add a haunting, human touch to key story moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're commanding armies or just soaking in the atmosphere, this soundtrack delivers the pulse, tension, and triumph of <i>Stormgate</i> in every track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original score spanning cinematic, ambient, and battle themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music for story arcs, gameplay moments and all three factions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in MP3 and high-quality lossless formats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the music of <i>Stormgate</i> guide you through the storm \u2014 and beyond.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3747630?t=1755183316","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3747630?t=1755183316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747630/b3251a27db44b231fd38ae8bd532028c3706f68f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755183316","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747630/b3251a27db44b231fd38ae8bd532028c3706f68f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755183316","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stormgate \u2013 Original Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Music by Nga Weng Chio, Frank Klepacki, Tracy Bush, David Ortega, Stephan Schutze &amp; Alexander Brandon</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Audio Direction by Alexander Brandon</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the heart of the conflict with the official <i>Stormgate</i> Original Soundtrack \u2014 a cinematic and emotional journey through Frost Giant Studios\u2019 epic real-time strategy universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With original music by Nga Weng Chio, Frank Klepacki, Tracy Bush, David Ortega, Stephan Schutze, and Audio Director Alexander Brandon, this dynamic soundtrack blends sweeping orchestral arrangements, gritty electronic textures, and powerful vocal performances to bring <i>Stormgate</i>'s world and factions to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack also features the ethereal voice of Ayana Haviv, whose vocals add a haunting, human touch to key story moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're commanding armies or just soaking in the atmosphere, this soundtrack delivers the pulse, tension, and triumph of <i>Stormgate</i> in every track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original score spanning cinematic, ambient, and battle themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music for story arcs, gameplay moments and all three factions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in MP3 and high-quality lossless formats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the music of <i>Stormgate</i> guide you through the storm \u2014 and beyond.</p>","developers":["Frost Giant Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2012510","name":"Stormgate"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747630/e586741735bc87e866a1507c49c91da34005d5d7/header.jpg?t=1755183316","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92020-2025 Frost Giant Studios, Inc. All rights reserved. Stormgate\u00ae and Frost Giant Studios are trademarks or registered trademarks of Frost Giant Studios, Inc. in the U.S. and/or other countries.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3747630/1798982518/69d57b72d0022f9c15131b2499bd419756ad84b2/1750387165/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754411302","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3747630/1798982518/69d57b72d0022f9c15131b2499bd419756ad84b2/1750387165/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754411302","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3747630/1798982518/69d57b72d0022f9c15131b2499bd419756ad84b2/1750387165/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754411302","id":257140672,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140672/movie480.mp4?t=1754411302","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140672/movie_max.mp4?t=1754411302"},"name":"Making of Celestial Music","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257140672/e0c277494b119556704cda7e69bd8a91b6262e81/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754411302","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140672/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754411302","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140672/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754411302"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3747630/910727252/d9cc95149a48bf3085a632e15faa3d6e86534969/1750387162/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754411304","dash_h264":"https://video.